    "commit": {
      "message": "Add Debug Workbench D6 runtime self-test suite r3"
    },
    "notes": [
      "D6 adds read-only runtime checks for handoff routes, browser scheme readiness, completed-file access, media sniffing, redaction, notification diagnostics, recorder health, support report readiness, and state context.",
      "r3 fixes the D6 r2 unit-test failure by using DebugRedactor.redactDetails for Authorization/Cookie smoke values and a bearer sample that matches the existing text redactor.",
      "The suite does not start downloads, launch viewers, inspect files, open schemes, run network probes, mutate storage, or upload reports.",
      "Normal UI uses human labels and sanitized copy reports; it does not render raw enum names, raw URLs, machine values, or secrets.",
      "Artifact validation works from Devtool temp-root layout and .devtool-artifact layout."
    ]
  },
